<h1 data-copy-en="Marina" data-copy-zh="Marina">Marina</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Fishing lessons, boat upgrades and the route to Sirena Isle." data-copy-zh="钓鱼课程、船只升级与塞壬岛航线。">Fishing lessons, boat upgrades and the route to Sirena Isle.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlocking_Sirena_Isle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Length_of_Rope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_and_Rope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Void_Leviathan_Challenge"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Boat_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fishing_Lesson_and_Caterpillar_Bait"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fishing_Results"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Starting_a_Fishing_Session"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fishing_and_Building_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Impossible_Catch"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_at_the_Dock"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Marina — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/marina.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Marina — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/marina.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Marina — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Marina provides fishing lessons, bait and boat upgrades. The fishing challenge, optional outings and Sirena Isle boat use separate requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule_and_Daily_Actions"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Her main portrait is at Fishing Hut, daily 04:00–16:59. At Known (25), visit Fishing Village (Coast) on even days 18:00–19:59 for personal talk and the dock heart-to-heart.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Plot_Choice_Reference"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Fishing Lesson needs Acknowledged (10), 120 minutes and $500, once. Caterpillar Bait also needs Acknowledged and 1,000,000 total caterpillars, with no time or money cost.</p><p>At Friend (100), start and finish The Impossible Catch in the hut at 10:00–13:59. Catch the required fish, then reach Close Friend (200) for The Impossible Wager; no additional 800- or 1,600-affection gate applies. Catch conditions are in the Fishing guide.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Fishing Hut</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fishing Hut; 04:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Feeding the Villages</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fishing Hut; 08:00–13:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Fishing Hut</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fishing Hut; 04:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after The Fishing Hut</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Impossible Catch</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Friend (100); 10:00–13:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">45 min; 5 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset at the Dock</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Village (Coast); Known (25); even days, 18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 5 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Boat upgrades start at her actual hut portrait, 04:00–16:59. The first needs Close Friend and Technology 50; the second follows it at Crush (400), and the third follows the second at Romantic (800). Costs are in the table; later upgrades require their indicated content access.</p><p>The island boat follows Sashimi’s separate An Island in Mind, costs $1,000,000 and 120 minutes and needs its own content access. It does not require Marina’s speed upgrades or high affection. Afterward, travel from the hut or pool takes 45 minutes.</p><p>A Length of Rope gives a rope tool once at Romantic. The coast heart-to-heart and Sunset Walk date are optional and do not gate boat upgrades.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Marina</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fishing Lesson</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $500</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caterpillar Bait</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Acknowledged (10); 1,000,000 total caterpillars</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Upgrade Boats</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Close Friend (200); Technology 50</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">240 min; $5,000; 60 common materials; 20 rare materials; 5 epic materials</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boat to Sirena Isle</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; after An Island in Mind; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $1,000,000</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Enhance Boat Speed</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Crush (400); after Marina's Boat Upgrade; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">240 min; $15,000; 80 common materials; 30 rare materials; 10 epic materials</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ultimate Speed Mastery</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Romantic (800); after Marina's Boat Speed Enhancement; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">240 min; $50,000; 160 common materials; 60 rare materials; 20 epic materials</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fishing Wisdom</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Known (25); Communication 35</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Commerce +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Length of Rope</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Impossible Wager</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Hut; Close Friend (200); after catch Void Leviathan / The Impossible Catch</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Personal Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Village (Coast); Known (25); even days, 18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+2 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Fishing Village (Coast); Close Friend (200); 18:00–19:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $50; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Use the Fishing and Caterpillar Rearing guides for bait effects, boat controls and population growth. The one-time lesson and upgrades cannot be repeated as affection purchases.</p><p>The learned Master Baiter skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Coast and hut menus differ; return to the hut for upgrades.</li><li>Start upgrades before her hut portrait ends at 17:00, rather than following older exterior hours.</li><li>The fishing reward needs the completed challenge conversation, its caught fish and Close Friend.</li><li>For the island boat check Sashimi’s proposal, money and access; Marina affection does not replace them.</li><li>The coast heart-to-heart needs Known and an even day 18:00–19:59.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-fishing.html">Fishing</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">Caterpillar Rearing</a></li><li><a href="character-sashimi.html">Sashimi</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unlocking_Sirena_Isle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Length_of_Rope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_and_Rope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Void_Leviathan_Challenge"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Boat_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fishing_Lesson_and_Caterpillar_Bait"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fishing_Results"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_a_Fishing_Session"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fishing_and_Building_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Impossible_Catch"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_at_the_Dock"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Marina 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/marina.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Marina 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/marina.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Marina 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Marina提供钓鱼课、鱼饵与船只升级。钓鱼挑战、可选关系活动和塞壬岛小船分别解锁。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule_and_Daily_Actions"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>主头像每天04:00—16:59在钓鱼小屋出现。已知（25）后，双数日18:00—19:59到渔村（海岸）可进行个人交谈与码头交心对话。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Plot_Choice_Reference"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>钓鱼课程要求已遇见（10），花费120分钟和$500，仅一次。毛虫鱼饵同样要求已遇见及毛虫总数1,000,000，不消耗时间或金钱。</p><p>朋友（100）后，于10:00—13:59在小屋开始并完成不可能的渔获。钓到指定鱼并达到亲密朋友（200）后，可进行不可能的赌约，不额外要求800或1,600好感。捕获条件见钓鱼指南。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">钓鱼小屋</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">钓鱼小屋; 04:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">养活村庄</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">钓鱼小屋; 08:00–13:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">钓鱼小屋</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">钓鱼小屋; 04:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：钓鱼小屋</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">不可能的渔获</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；朋友（100）；10:00–13:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">45分钟；5精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">码头日落</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">渔村（海岸）；已知（25）；双数日，18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；5精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>船只升级从04:00—16:59的小屋头像开始。第一项要求亲密朋友和科技50；第二项需完成第一项并达到迷恋（400）；第三项需完成第二项并达到浪漫感（800）。消耗见表，后两项另需对应内容权限。</p><p>塞壬岛小船要求Sashimi独立的心中的小岛，花费$1,000,000和120分钟，另需自己的内容权限，不要求Marina船速升级或高好感。解锁后从小屋或泳池出发，路程45分钟。</p><p>浪漫感后的一段绳索会一次性给予绳索工具。海岸交心对话与日落散步是可选活动，不是船只升级前置条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Marina交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">钓鱼课程</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$500</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">毛虫鱼饵</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；已遇见（10）；毛虫总数1,000,000</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">升级船只</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；亲密朋友（200）；科技50</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">240分钟；$5,000；普通材料×60；稀有材料×20；史诗材料×5</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">乘船前往塞壬岛</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；完成：心中的小岛；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$1,000,000</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">提升船速</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；迷恋（400）；完成：Marina的船只升级；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">240分钟；$15,000；普通材料×80；稀有材料×30；史诗材料×10</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">终极速度精通</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；浪漫感（800）；完成：Marina的船速强化；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">240分钟；$50,000；普通材料×160；稀有材料×60；史诗材料×20</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">渔业智慧</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；已知（25）；沟通35</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；商业+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一段绳索</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；浪漫感（800）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不可能的赌约</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">钓鱼小屋；亲密朋友（200）；完成：钓到虚空利维坦、不可能的渔获</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人谈话</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">渔村（海岸）；已知（25）；双数日，18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+2；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">渔村（海岸）；亲密朋友（200）；18:00–19:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$50；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>鱼饵效果、船只操作与种群培养详见钓鱼和毛虫饲养指南。课程与升级不能重复购买刷好感。</p><p>学会钓饵大师可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>海岸与小屋菜单不同，升级要回小屋查看。</li><li>小屋头像17:00结束，升级请在实际出现时开始，不要沿用旧屋外时段。</li><li>钓鱼奖励需完成挑战对话、钓到指定鱼并达到亲密朋友。</li><li>岛屿小船需检查Sashimi提议、金钱与权限，Marina好感不能代替。</li><li>海岸交心对话需已知，双数日18:00—19:59开始。</li></ul></section>
